        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>God Noval needs you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinity Boli is a thrilling 45 degree top-down Roguelike game. In this game, facing the crazy invasion of the Bolibirds army, players will select four animal heroes recognized by the deity to form an ideal combat lineup. Through hundreds of rich relics and powerful equipment, as well as different types of bird eggs, players will strengthen themselves and discover the strongest structures that can produce snowball effects to defeat the invasion of the Bolibirds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446270/extras/2d685bc09cdfb94796309e2d0847ab0a.avif?t=1759113360\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten unique heroes with their own characteristics,   you can find your own unique combat style (mage, warrior and other types)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 150 unique relics and equipment are available for you to freely choose and stack, developing your own strongest genre!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your damage as much as possible, allowing your combo count to surpass the sky to obtain higher clearance scores!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose five powerful divine weapons to change the character's attack form!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize the eggs of the Bolibird and hatch them to obtain the gift of the Void - Wafer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple random level mechanisms, make use of them to turn your weaknesses into advantages!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random level map, plan the optimal  path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the game too simple? Then go challenge the endless mode and 5 different levels of difficulty</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
